# Settings > Updates > System packages (report 047 P3): the states of the page and of its row on the Updates page.
#   1. the scan has not ended: "checking", "Reading the package lists..."; then it ends
#   2. nothing to upgrade: the lists are from today, "Up to date" in green, the page says "Nothing to upgrade"; the
#      detection rows (D18, shown and never changed): automatic updates on, 2 held packages
#   3. the deck's capture: apt offers Debian's own 2048 [0.1.0 -> 1.0.3-1], and 2048 is a Store app: not an update, left
#      out ("Store apps left out 1"), still "Up to date"
#   4. the lists were never refreshed: "not checked", the page says to refresh first
#   5. the lists are 9 days old: "Lists are 9 days old"
#   6. apt gives no plan (a lock, a broken dpkg): "Check failed"
#   7. no apt-get at all
# Keys only. Review only: no golden; the headers are checked against the home grid's.
title updates system states
review
sizes 640x480 480x800 480x640 720x720 1280x800 480x320
@480x800,480x640 profile pda
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
env HARNESS_APPS catalogue
env M5APPSTORE_STATE_DIR /nonexistent/harness-appstore
apps Settings CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30 2026-11-01
wifi 70
bt on
update net on
update build 0.9.1 release arm64
update answer releases-real.json
apt board pending
apt lists-age 0
apt holds 2
apt auto on
home
launch Settings
wait 300
key UP
key UP
key UP
key UP
# 1. the scan does not end (the first scan of the run: no earlier result to show meanwhile)
apt board pending
key ENTER
wait 1000
shot states_pending_root
expect_text "checking"
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 600
shot states_pending
expect_text "Reading the package lists"
apt lists-age 0
apt board empty
wait 4000
shot states_pending_done
key ESC
key ESC
# 2. nothing to upgrade
key ENTER
wait 4000
shot states_empty_root
expect_text "Up to date"
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 600
shot states_empty
expect_text "Nothing to upgrade"
expect_text "Held packages"
key ESC
key ESC
# 3. the deck
apt board deck
apt holds 0
apt auto board
key ENTER
wait 4000
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 600
shot states_store
expect_text "Store apps left out"
key ESC
key ESC
# 4. never refreshed
apt board pi3a-dsi
apt lists-age never
key ENTER
wait 4000
shot states_never_root
expect_text "not checked"
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 600
shot states_never
expect_text "never"
key ESC
key ESC
# 5. old lists
apt lists-age 9
key ENTER
wait 4000
shot states_old_root
expect_text "Lists are 9 days old"
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 600
shot states_old
key ESC
key ESC
# 6. no plan
apt board error
key ENTER
wait 4000
shot states_error_root
expect_text "Check failed"
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 600
shot states_error
key ESC
key ESC
# 7. no apt-get
apt board none
key ENTER
wait 4000
expect_text "Check failed"
key ESC
